      "content": "that's pretty intense. but what about the people who work in coal? people say it's the only way to keep the economy stable in certain areas and keep energy costs down. im not sure if \"destroying our future\" is a fair way to put it if it's keeping millions of families afloat. dont you think it's more complicated than that?",
